      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Plato used the allegory of the cave to illustrate how perceptions could give one a limited interpretation of reality. If all you know is shadows...that is reality for you.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "758860_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "and now on to our next question...because all I know are questions...",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "758861_4",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "So let’s say I’m starting to suspect reality isn’t what I thought it was...(neverously) which, I know... seems CRAZY...How would Plato describe my completely theoretical predicament?",
